。進之曰：「非吾志也。」竟不行。武帝嘉之。梁台建，曆尚書左丞，廣平、天門二郡太守，左衞將軍，封建甯公。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001:m0000","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001","surface":"輿之子進之","start":0,"end":5}}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"傳首具名父子。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAA","label":"王清（王進之子，中廬公）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"清","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0003","c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0072","c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0104","c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0114","c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p001:m0013"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0003"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0072"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0104"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0114"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangmeng-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p001:m0013"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南24具名父進之，遇害，子猛。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_d